      "writtenOn": "2018-11-15T04:35:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "May rename it having the term \"TABLET\". As it breaks clamshell, which starts a clean shutdown after pressing the power button for 3s. So when holding the power button for 10s. It initiates a power-on again. I think we have rk3399 clamshell, right?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 552,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 552,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "fa1e381ef9ff1d36e3805566e58a8615547f1893",
